    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AcroChallenge is a simple, yet fun and creative word game where you compete against others to make the\u00a0best phrase that fits a 3 to 7 letter acronym (ie. &quot;ABCG&quot;) generated by the server.\u00a0 Race against the clock to create the best phrase (ie. &quot;Already Been Chewed Gum&quot;).\u00a0 Impress  your friends with your wit and intellect, or just entertain them with stupid and funny phrases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose how to play - against bots, with Stream friends or make new friends.\u00a0 If you want simple - one click will get you into a random game.\u00a0 Or you can create your own game - play against just bots or with only Steam friends (coming soon).\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it more challenging by including per-round 'Topics' that can be set by the server, game winner, or game creator.\u00a0 Once in a game you can chat with other players as well.\u00a0 But don't worry, you can 'mute' them if you don't like what they have to say.</p>",
